  "description": "Beta Jin Yu-Seom dismisses ruts and hits, which he has never experienced before, as the pranks of weaklings. But how dare he use ruts as an excuse to free ride on my group project? Angry, Yu-Seom goes to the house of the free-riding group member Alpha Baek Cheong-Jin, but somehow Cheong-Jin's condition doesn't seem good.\n\n *\"Jin Yu-Seom, can you help me out?\"*\n\nThis guy, it wasn't an excuse, it was a real rut?!\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
